From d6ddccf1ddc95b37d198ad9649fa285d33309639 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AMB-1 FM6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:30:01 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] 1.4.1: the reel's five modulators, as a voice's; a
 modulator's depth and rate a target, the voices' and the reel's

- the reel's modulators five, each Target, Depth, Rate, Shape, Sync (Free, Tempo), Smooth; two pages as a voice's MOD,
  KNOB 1 picking the modulator
- a target of another modulator's depth (+-50) or rate (+-2 octaves), M1..M5: in the voices' MOD (by the voice's
  first note's value, a block late) and the reel's (a chunk late)
- the project in two store objects: the settings to P_SPLIT in OBJ_PROJ, the reel's in OBJ_TAPE (0xDA000): nine
  pieces' worth no longer fit one; format 13 (12 carried over, its two modulators into the five)
- MIDI CC 50..91 on channel 16 the reel's

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
